neous-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary\">../batch09/58-df-elementary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"58-df-isomorphism\">58-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in V\">\\(K\\in V\\)</span> (set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structures under consideration)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\in V\\)</span> (monster-model candidate), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span> (signature), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (size bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S\\)</span> (fixed-language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-saturation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4519dfdd6e3aa4d9\" href=\"?note=4519dfdd6e3aa4d9\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-kappa-saturated\">../batch17/58-df-kappa-saturated</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S\\)</span> (strong homogeneity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"21aca82552a5a872\" href=\"?note=21aca82552a5a872\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-homogeneous-model\">../batch06/58-df-homogeneous-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\)</span> (fixed-language elementary-substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary\">../batch09/58-df-elementary</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S\\)</span> (fixed-language isomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"58-df-isomorphism\">58-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S\\)</span> (monster-model predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}monster\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land|\\mathcal L|&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\mathfrak C\\in K\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall M\\in K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall M\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|&lt;\\kappa\\to\n\\exists M&#39;,f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(M&#39;,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,M,M&#39;,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}monster\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land|\\mathcal L|&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\mathfrak C\\in K\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S(\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall M\\in K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall M\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathrm{Univ}(M)|&lt;\\kappa\\to\n\\exists M&#39;,f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(M&#39;,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,M,M&#39;,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Saturation, homogeneity, and universality are all bound to the displayed language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi